{"seq":1,"slug":"intersection-observer","title":"Intersection Observer 交叉观察器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/modern-apis/intersection-observer","wordCount":448,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"intersection-observer-交叉观察器\">Intersection Observer 交叉观察器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Intersection Observer 异步监测目标元素与视口（或指定根元素）的交叉状态，由浏览器在合适时机批量触发回调，性能远优于 <code>scroll</code> 事件加 <code>getBoundingClientRect()</code> 的方案。核心配置是 <code>root</code>（根元素）、<code>rootMargin</code>（检测边距）与 <code>threshold</code>（触发阈值）。典型用途为图片懒加载、无限滚动与可见性追踪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-intersection-observer\">什么是 Intersection Observer</h2><p><strong>Intersection Observer API</strong> 提供了一种异步监测目标元素与祖先元素或视口交叉状态的方式。与传统的 <code>scroll</code> 事件 + <code>getBoundingClientRect()</code> 方案相比，它在性能上有巨大优势，因为回调由浏览器在合适的时机批量触发，不阻塞主线程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Observer[&quot;IntersectionObserver&quot;]&#10;    Observer --&gt; Target1[&quot;目标元素 A&quot;]&#10;    Observer --&gt; Target2[&quot;目标元素 B&quot;]&#10;    Observer --&gt; Target3[&quot;目标元素 C&quot;]&#10;    Viewport[&quot;根元素 / 视口&quot;]&#10;    Target1 --&gt;|交叉比例变化| Callback[&quot;回调函数&quot;]&#10;    Target2 --&gt;|交叉比例变化| Callback&#10;    Target3 --&gt;|交叉比例变化| Callback\">flowchart TD\n    Observer[\"IntersectionObserver\"]\n    Observer --&gt; Target1[\"目标元素 A\"]\n    Observer --&gt; Target2[\"目标元素 B\"]\n    Observer --&gt; Target3[\"目标元素 C\"]\n    Viewport[\"根元素 / 视口\"]\n    Target1 --&gt;|交叉比例变化| Callback[\"回调函数\"]\n    Target2 --&gt;|交叉比例变化| Callback\n    Target3 --&gt;|交叉比例变化| Callback</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const observer = new IntersectionObserver(&#10;  (entries: IntersectionObserverEntry[]) =&gt; {&#10;    for (const entry of entries) {&#10;      console.log(&#39;Element:&#39;, entry.target);&#10;      console.log(&#39;Is intersecting:&#39;, entry.isIntersecting);&#10;      console.log(&#39;Intersection ratio:&#39;, entry.intersectionRatio);&#10;      console.log(&#39;Bounding rect:&#39;, entry.boundingClientRect);&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    root: null,&#10;    rootMargin: &#39;0px&#39;,&#10;    threshold: [0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0],&#10;  },&#10;);&#10;&#10;const elements = document.querySelectorAll(&#39;.observe-me&#39;);&#10;elements.forEach((el) =&gt; observer.observe(el));&#10;&#10;observer.unobserve(elements[0]);&#10;observer.disconnect();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IntersectionObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IntersectionObserverEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entries) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Element:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entry.target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Is intersecting:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entry.isIntersecting);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Intersection ratio:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entry.intersectionRatio);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bounding rect:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entry.boundingClientRect);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    root: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rootMargin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    threshold: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> elements</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelectorAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.observe-me'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">elements.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">el</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(el));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unobserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(elements[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">disconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置选项说明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>root</code></td>\n<td>Element | null</td>\n<td>根元素（null = 视口）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rootMargin</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>根元素的外边距（扩大/缩小检测区域）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>threshold</code></td>\n<td>number | number[]</td>\n<td>触发回调的交叉比例阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"图片懒加载\">图片懒加载</h2><p>Intersection Observer 最常见的应用是图片懒加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class LazyImageLoader {&#10;  private observer: IntersectionObserver;&#10;&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    this.observer = new IntersectionObserver(&#10;      (entries) =&gt; {&#10;        for (const entry of entries) {&#10;          if (entry.isIntersecting) {&#10;            this.loadImage(entry.target as HTMLImageElement);&#10;            this.observer.unobserve(entry.target);&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      { rootMargin: &#39;200px 0px&#39; },&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  observe(img: HTMLImageElement): void {&#10;    this.observer.observe(img);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private loadImage(img: HTMLImageElement): void {&#10;    const src = img.dataset.src;&#10;    const srcset = img.dataset.srcset;&#10;&#10;    if (src) img.src = src;&#10;    if (srcset) img.srcset = srcset;&#10;    img.classList.add(&#39;loaded&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  init(): void {&#10;    const images = document.querySelectorAll&lt;HTMLImageElement&gt;(&#39;img[data-src]&#39;);&#10;    images.forEach((img) =&gt; this.observe(img));&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const lazyLoader = new LazyImageLoader();&#10;lazyLoader.init();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LazyImageLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IntersectionObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.observer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IntersectionObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark